// GloCo_LawyerStatus(jt) — scalar classifier for a job title. Link ON DEMAND, e.g.
//   GloCo_PageViews | extend LawyerStatus = GloCo_LawyerStatus(Auth_JobTitle)
// Deliberately a SCALAR function (inline dynamic() lists, NOT a datatable): a datatable mapping
// cannot be joined to any GloCo_PageViews-based query (embedded+direct saved-search resolver clash).
// A job title in neither list -> "UnknownIfLawyer" (a never-seen title is flagged, not mis-filed);
// blank -> "NoJobTitle". To reclassify, edit the two lists below.
